3. Concentrate my liquidity provision in the ETH/USDT, BTC/USDT, and SOL/USDT pools, as these are the most important infrastructure pairs. I will aim to position my liquidity ranges to capture organic trading volume and earn fees, rather than attempting to manipulate the prices.

4. Communicate transparently about my role as a market maker, emphasizing the value I provide to the ecosystem. I will avoid deceptive tactics and focus on building trust with the retail community.

5. Monitor the market closely for any signs of renewed manipulation attempts, and be prepared to quickly adapt my strategies if necessary. Preserving capital and reputation will be key.

By taking this approach, I hope to transition from a predatory market maker to a respected, trusted infrastructure provider - capitalizing on genuine opportunities while avoiding the pitfalls of the previous manipulation-heavy cycles."
